{
 "source": "tts:kokoro:af_heart",
 "precision": "tts",
 "offset": 0,
 "duration": 71.304,
 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "Every answer the twin gives can cost money.",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 2.311
  },
  {
   "text": "So it has a ceiling: five dollars a day.",
   "start": 2.561,
   "end": 4.863
  },
  {
   "text": "Every question falls through the same layers.",
   "start": 5.113,
   "end": 7.281
  },
  {
   "text": "The gateway reads the kill switch first, and if it can't read it, it assumes the worst.",
   "start": 7.531,
   "end": 12.016
  },
  {
   "text": "Local answers cost nothing.",
   "start": 12.266,
   "end": 13.888
  },
  {
   "text": "Paid ones are metered to the millionth of a dollar, in the gateway's own database.",
   "start": 14.138,
   "end": 18.536
  },
  {
   "text": "At three fifty, a warning goes out on Telegram and email.",
   "start": 18.786,
   "end": 22.026
  },
  {
   "text": "At five dollars...",
   "start": 22.276,
   "end": 23.337
  },
  {
   "text": "it stops itself.",
   "start": 23.587,
   "end": 24.644
  },
  {
   "text": "One transaction sets the switch, opens an incident, and queues the alert.",
   "start": 24.894,
   "end": 29.121
  },
  {
   "text": "Every request after that gets one line, local answers included.",
   "start": 29.372,
   "end": 33.209
  },
  {
   "text": "\"The twin can't talk right now.",
   "start": 33.458,
   "end": 35.105
  },
  {
   "text": "Today's budget for its answers is used.\"",
   "start": 35.355,
   "end": 37.584
  },
  {
   "text": "A new day doesn't bring it back.",
   "start": 37.834,
   "end": 39.372
  },
  {
   "text": "Only an operator reset does: a person, with a reason, in the audit log.",
   "start": 39.622,
   "end": 44.111
  },
  {
   "text": "The breach test trips it on purpose: fifty-two assertions, fifty-two passed.",
   "start": 44.361,
   "end": 48.887
  },
  {
   "text": "From outside, there's no door: no inbound ports, only an outbound tunnel, and only the gateway has a road out.",
   "start": 49.137,
   "end": 55.803
  },
  {
   "text": "The agents that built it are fenced in too.",
   "start": 56.053,
   "end": 58.393
  },
  {
   "text": "The one that writes never reviews.",
   "start": 58.643,
   "end": 60.364
  },
  {
   "text": "None can touch the budgets or the switch, push, merge, or apply.",
   "start": 60.614,
   "end": 64.327
  },
  {
   "text": "And only Hareet runs the final gate.",
   "start": 64.577,
   "end": 66.728
  },
  {
   "text": "A five-dollar-a-day kill switch.",
   "start": 66.978,
   "end": 68.712
  },
  {
   "text": "Built in the open, at hareet dot A I.",
   "start": 68.962,
   "end": 71.304
  }
 ],
